ans-serif; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-stretch: normal; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\">- Meningkatkan kemampuan kepemimpinan</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; caret-color: #212529; color: #212529; font-family: Apercu, sans-serif; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-stretch: normal; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\">- Membantu merealisasikan projek baru</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; caret-color: #212529; color: #212529; font-family: Apercu, sans-serif; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-stretch: normal; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; caret-color: #212529; color: #212529; font-family: Apercu, sans-serif; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-stretch: normal; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Ini adalah kristal yang sering dipakai oleh para calon pemimpin dunia di awal pertualangan baru mereka.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; caret-color: #212529; color: #212529; font-family: Apercu, sans-serif; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-stretch: normal; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; caret-color: #212529; color: #212529; font-family: Apercu, sans-serif; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-stretch: normal; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\">Carnelian akan membantu kamu meng-akses energi kemenangan yang terdapat dalam dirimu sendir